From: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 11:59:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] player process info (PPI) panel

Player process info ported from jamal2362's Estuary Hybrid: a CPM-style
DialogPlayerProcessInfo and an OSD overlay toggled by a PPI button,
fed by extras/ppi_sysfs.py (Amlogic DV/HDR/output sysfs readouts), with an
OSD toggle button, status variables, FontAwesome icons (font_tiny), en_gb strings
31630-31641 and the Hungarian translation. Touches VideoOSD.xml,
DialogPlayerProcessInfo.xml, Variables.xml, Font.xml, strings.
